  "bodyHash": "NELKVXHLcH0=",
  "content": "<p><span><span><strong>本模組新增了大量互不相關的物品、工具、機器、附魔以及少數藥水。<br></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>建議安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>模組並查看輪迴指南書物品(1.16+版本)以學習本模組內容。</strong></span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong>1.12版本可使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guide-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guide API</a>編寫的類似指南書</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組包開發者可參考<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處&nbsp;</a>的範例設定檔與腳本</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>必要依賴</h3><p>在Minecraft-1.20及更新版本中，本模組需依賴此函式庫模組<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib\" rel=\"nofollow\">FLIB</a>，舊版Minecraft仍無需任何依賴且該函式庫不會回溯移植</p><h2>選用依賴</h2><p>以下模組非必要，但若同時安裝將增強輪迴模組的內建功能</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>查閱舊版本請在網站檔案頁面點選「查看全部」並使用篩選選單。快速連結：</p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:6170\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.10.2</a></span></p><p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2</a></strong> </span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.16.5</strong></a> </span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.18.2</strong></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9366\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.19.2</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.12/scripts_zen_example\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.12 Crafttweaker範例</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>設定檔：請查看位於/mods/資料夾同層的/config/資料夾內生成的設定檔。亦可透過問題回報連結至Github網站查看範例設定檔。所有版本模組皆含一或多個設定檔<br></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>例如1.16.5等新版有<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic.toml</a>與<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic-client.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic-client.toml</a>檔案</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>而1.12.2亦有兩個設定檔<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.12/cyclicmagic.cfg\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclicmagic.cfg</a>與cyclic_ores.cfg</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>技術說明 - 使用之第三方工具</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>音效製作：BFXR <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.bfxr.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.bfxr.net/</a></p>\n<p>部分模型使用Crayfish Model Creator輔助製作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmrcrayfish.com%252ftools%253fid%253dmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mrcrayfish.com/tools?id=mc</a></p>\n<p>程式開發：採用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge API</a>，使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.eclipse.org%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eclipse</a>與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgradle.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gradle</a><br>材質繪製：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.getpaint.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paint.net</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;開源鳴謝！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>秉持開源精神，感謝以下模組作者允許我在輪迴模組中使用其部分程式碼</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Botania - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b75dedf899a086414b16cb8ce3bcc62cc5b4c9d/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/Vector3.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vector3類別&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li>Not Enough Wands - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L252\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenGL渲染函式&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li>Builders Guides - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L324\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenGL渲染函式</a></li>\n<li>Random Things - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b61a4d1dd6b8d5732f69674b62282068ca3be19/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/component/miner/TileEntityBlockMiner.java#L28\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用假玩家使方塊實體影響世界</a></li>\n<li>Baubles - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilPlayerInventoryFilestorage.java#L17\" rel=\"nofollow\">將玩家物品欄儲存為二進位檔案</a></li>\n<li>Vanilla Automation - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/proxy/ClientProxy.java#L267\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用PlayerControllerMP調整玩家互動距離</a></li>\n<li>Sponge -<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/issues/143\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 協助處理網路封包、多執行緒、併發例外與伺服器排程任務</a></li>\n<li>Ellpeck (AA) 提供<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/db9728eeb846c5a5dfa495c792895fc64fb961a3/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/block/base/TileEntityBaseMachineInvo.java#L144\" rel=\"nofollow\">優美的能量傳輸程式碼</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;教學/指南/參考文獻鳴謝！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbedrockminer.jimdo.com%252fmodding-tutorials%252fbasic-modding-1-7%252fcustom-tools-swords%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">工具製作</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fExperience%2523Leveling_up\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家經驗值</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%252ftopic%252c7146.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">查找現有配方</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.com.au%252f2015%252f01%252ftileentity.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊實體</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodwiki.temporal-reality.com%252fmw%252findex.php%252fRender_Block_TESR_%252f_OBJ-1.9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TESR渲染</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/modification-development/1432714-forge-using-addinformation-on-a-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemBlock元數據</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fwiki%252fContainers_and_GUIs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f28330-solvedtileentity-implementing-iupdateplayerlistbox-only-working-clientside%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階方塊實體</a>&nbsp;與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31953.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">此篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d30567.\" rel=\"nofollow\">粒子效果</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d29544.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊狀態變更</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d25937.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊旋轉</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d39162.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端-伺服器同步</a>&nbsp;與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38710.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">此篇</a>&nbsp;及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d15351.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">此篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fjabelarminecraft.blogspot.ca%252fp%252fminecraft-forge-creating-custom.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">成就系統</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.ca%252f2014%252f12%252ftransparent-blocks-18.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊透明度</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d22378.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI文字輸入</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31853.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端代理技巧</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38076.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂音效</a>&nbsp;與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d37547.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">此篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/mapping-and-modding-tutorials/1571434-tutorial-modding-with-apis\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用JEI或Baubles等模組API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d27684.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">代理渲染</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d11024.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">藥水效果</a>&nbsp;與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d12358.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">藥水材質</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d24403.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">圓形與球體生成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f37202-19-playerinteractevent-for-right-click-no-longer-works%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家事件</a>&nbsp;與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31966.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">此篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d43152.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體傷害</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>請將所有請求、錯誤、報告和崩潰日誌提交到 GitHub 問題頁面</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
